      "opening": {
        "caption_gap_checked": true,
        "caption_samples": [
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 3.57531566666667,
            "text": "听见了吗？下雨的时候，"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 6.34668533333333,
            "text": "老城就是这个声儿。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 11.4763503333333,
            "text": "从前啊，夜市一开灯，"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 14.5835716666667,
            "text": "谁家的窗户都舍不得关。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 20.8612698571428,
            "text": "后来，街拆了。我就一层一层，"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 23.692806,
            "text": "把它刻在纸里。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 31.091627,
            "text": "这张纸呀，最怕沾上墨水。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 38.2787933333334,
            "text": "一小滴，也能把一条街的模样，慢慢盖住。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 47.0637282727273,
            "text": "可灯一亮，你听，它们又热闹起来了。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 56.046565111111,
            "text": "卖汽水的，修车的，"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 58.6347203333332,
            "text": "还有总不肯早早回家的小麻雀。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 68.3448939999999,
            "text": "要是哪天，你看见城里暗了一块，别怕。"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 76.2707792222221,
            "text": "把光照过去。记着，照走的是墨，留下的，"
          },
          {
            "matches": true,
            "media_seconds": 79.2934199999998,
            "text": "是咱们的城。"
          }
        ],
